            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Harry J.F. Korrell, the denial raises concerns under the Equal Protection Clause, which requires the government to treat individuals, not merely members of a racial class."
      }
